<title>DENMARK: Danish ISS buys Swedish care service.</title>
<headline>Danish ISS buys Swedish care service.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning group International Service System (ISS) said on Tuesday its ISS Care Service unit acquired Swedish Vaard i Stockholm AB care centres for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Vaard has since 1995 operated collective residential care centres for the elderly, ISS Sweden's ISS Care Service employs 10,000 staff at 400 locations in Sweden.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
